>> Combination := Lis nouvo.

Combination lè: ['ajoute-nan-fen:'] fè: { :el
	tèt-li 
	jwenn: el, Anyen? vre: { tèt-li ajoute-nan-fen: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination nouvo.
colours
	ajoute-nan-fen: ['red'],
	ajoute-nan-fen: ['green'],
	ajoute-nan-fen: ['blue'],
	ajoute-nan-fen: ['red'].

Sòti ekri: colours, nouvo-liy.
